units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3008
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
region target block 0 20 0 20 -43 -3 units lattice
region system block 0 20 0 20 -43 20 units lattice
create_box 2 system
create_atoms 1 region projectile
create_atoms 2 region target
mass 1 92.90638
mass 2 92.90638
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /scratch/gilbreth/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt3.potential Nb Nb
velocity all create 300.0 12345 dist gaussian
fix 1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
run 10
group proj region projectile
velocity proj set 0.0 0.0 -20.0 sum yes units box
fix 2 all nve
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
run 10
